  "translation": "A yɛ ⟨את⟩ sarakalasebaga bɛɛ Yuda duguw na bɔ, ka ⟨את⟩ bamɔw nɔngɔya minnu la sarakalasebagaw bɛ saraka-fin bɔ yen — Gueba (Geba) fɛ ka se Bere-Shaba (Beer-Sheba) ma — ka ⟨את⟩ da-bamɔw minnu bɛ Yehoshua (Yezu), dugu ɲɛmɔgɔ ka da ɲɛ, min bɛ cɛkɛ kɔgɔda fɛ dugu da la, wotɔ.",
